  "title": "Strawberry-Feta Chicken Salad with Roasted Strawberry-Balsamic Dressing",
  "description": "Crisp lettuce is topped with chicken, feta cheese, strawberries, and a roasted strawberry-balsamic dressing for the ultimate sweet and tangy summer salad.",
